        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased from F. Gregory in 1901.  RF# 89271/1901.  Note on Registered Description:  \"Mr Gregory stated that his wife sat to Lord Leighton in this dress for the 'Sister's Kiss'.  The dress then belonged to Lord Leighton, who bought it in Italy, and is said to have given £45 for it.\""@en ;
